cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RCausticMass: Caustic Mass Estimator for Galaxy Clusters"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Fonticiella Morell"
    given-names: "Dailer"
    name-particle: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dailer/RCausticMass"
abstract: >
  An R implementation of the caustic technique for estimating galaxy
  cluster mass profiles to clustrocentric distances well beyond the
  virial radius, using only galaxy redshift information. Based on the
  method of Diaferio & Geller (1997) and Diaferio (1999), and on the
  Python implementation of Gifford, Miller & Kern (2013).
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - galaxy clusters
  - caustic technique
  - mass estimation
license: MIT
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  authors:
    - family-names: "Diaferio"
      given-names: "Antonaldo"
  title: "Mass estimation in the outer regions of galaxy clusters"
  year: 1999
  journal: "Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society"
